# Objectives

The main objectives of Pocket Smart AI are:

1. To develop a simple AI-powered smart assistant.
2. To provide quick and useful responses to user queries.
3. To create an easy-to-use interface.
4. To demonstrate the practical use of Generative AI.
5. To reduce the complexity of interacting with AI systems.
6. To provide a platform that can be extended with additional AI features.
7. To develop a project that is useful for students and general users.
